        "review_required": true
      },
      {
        "id": "SHEET01-FORMING",
        "text": "Use R1-selected stock and complete current source rule, R3 neutral-factor K and evaluated square relief dimensions, R4 split-lip/rear sequence, revised R5 throat arithmetic and actual tool/flat clearances. Retain all applicable supplier constraints and disclosed uncertainty; no supplier approval claim.",
